{"v":2,"voice":"ziggy-v2","locale":"fr","story":"d21","segments":{"title":{"file":"title.mp3","dur":2.14,"text":"Le paon et le moineau","words":[0.12,0.495,0.82,0.92,1.095],"visemes":[[0.0,"smile"],[0.295,"grin"],[0.52,"small"],[0.595,"smile"],[0.67,"open"],[0.845,"grin"],[1.12,"small"],[1.195,"o"],[1.27,"open"],[1.37,"grin"],[1.445,"smile"],[1.52,"o"],[1.665,"smile"]]},"s1":{"file":"s1.mp3","dur":26.79,"text":"Dans un grand jardin plein de roses vivait un paon nommé Léopold. Chaque matin, il ouvrait sa queue comme un éventail bleu et vert. « Regardez-moi ! Je suis le plus beau du jardin ! » disait-il. Tout près, sur une branche de lilas, un petit moineau brun gazouillait doucement. Il s’appelait Pipo. Il ne disait rien. Il souriait, simplement.","words":[0.12,0.55,0.725,1.075,1.7,1.95,2.175,2.7,3.175,3.35,3.55,3.85,5.23,5.68,6.405,6.555,6.98,7.205,7.405,7.58,7.68,8.305,8.605,8.755,9.72,9.72,11.42,11.42,11.72,11.87,12.07,12.345,12.545,12.72,13.76,13.76,13.76,15.28,15.555,15.88,16.105,16.255,16.68,16.83,17.63,17.83,18.23,18.655,18.955,19.43,20.67,21.02,21.47,22.55,22.85,23.025,23.45,24.54,24.92,25.495],"visemes":[[0.0,"smile"],[0.25,"grin"],[0.325,"open"],[0.45,"grin"],[0.575,"o"],[0.75,"grin"],[0.925,"open"],[1.1,"grin"],[1.175,"open"],[1.275,"grin"],[1.425,"smile"],[1.5,"grin"],[1.725,"small"],[1.8,"grin"],[2.275,"smile"],[2.375,"o"],[2.525,"grin"],[2.725,"small"],[2.8,"grin"],[2.9,"small"],[3.025,"grin"],[3.2,"o"],[3.375,"small"],[3.475,"open"],[3.575,"grin"],[3.65,"o"],[3.725,"small"],[3.825,"grin"],[4.05,"o"],[4.175,"small"],[4.25,"smile"],[4.375,"o"],[4.475,"grin"],[4.715,"smile"],[5.38,"grin"],[5.48,"open"],[5.58,"grin"],[5.705,"small"],[5.78,"open"],[5.905,"grin"],[6.005,"smile"],[6.08,"grin"],[6.155,"smile"],[6.43,"grin"],[6.58,"o"],[6.68,"small"],[6.755,"grin"],[7.08,"open"],[7.23,"grin"],[7.33,"o"],[7.53,"small"],[7.605,"o"],[7.655,"grin"],[7.755,"small"],[7.83,"open"],[7.905,"smile"],[7.98,"grin"],[8.055,"smile"],[8.13,"open"],[8.205,"grin"],[8.33,"small"